{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"211854977f1a02174da8b739ebbdb4a515724acffe38ca7681d2350d66c9a8b6","slug":"repos.tutorial.analisis-data-dem-menggunakan-r","location":"/repos/tutorial/analisis-data-dem-menggunakan-r.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Analisis-Data-DEM-Menggunakan-R","authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Defani Arman Alfitriansyah","given":"Defani Arman","family":"Alfitriansyah"},"name":"Defani Arman Alfitriansyah","email":"defaniarman@gmail.com","affiliations":["Program Studi Kehutanan, Universitas Kuningan"],"github":"Defani","linkedin":"https://linkedin.com/in/defaniarmanalfitriansyah","id":"contributors-Users\\ASUS\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--\\63433157-e353-4831-a006-1d7091d9a721\\scratchpad\\site-myst\\myst-generated-uid-0","corresponding":true}],"github":"https://github.com/Defani/Defani","keywords":["forestry","remote sensing","GIS","Google Earth Engine","GeoLibre","QGIS","forest carbon","WebGIS"],"affiliations":[{"id":"Program Studi Kehutanan, Universitas Kuningan","name":"Program Studi Kehutanan, Universitas Kuningan"}],"abbreviations":{"GIS":"Geographic Information System","GEE":"Google Earth Engine","SQL":"Structured Query Language","BIG":"Badan Informasi Geospasial (Indonesian Geospatial Information Agency)","KLHK":"Kementerian Lingkungan Hidup dan Kehutanan (Ministry of Environment and Forestry)","BMKG":"Badan Meteorologi, Klimatologi, dan Geofisika","TNGC":"Taman Nasional Gunung Ciremai (Mount Ciremai National Park)","RBI":"Rupabumi Indonesia (official topographic base map)","EUDR":"EU Deforestation Regulation","GBIF":"Global Biodiversity Information Facility"},"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"analisis-data-dem-menggunakan-r.md","url":"/build/analisis-data-dem-me-e6067a8a0d0e5b8e67ae4a7feee07d65.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/Defani/Analisis-Data-DEM-Menggunakan-R","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Repositori di GitHub","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"OR6Bo4VGzN"}],"urlSource":"https://github.com/Defani/Analisis-Data-DEM-Menggunakan-R","error":true,"key":"OpCbXdVXpw"}],"key":"UqDry3yxFq"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pengolahan Data DEM di R untuk Analisis Topografi\nRepositori ini berisi skrip R untuk pengolahan data Digital Elevation Model (DEM) guna analisis topografi. Skrip ini mendemonstrasikan alur kerja dasar analisis spasial menggunakan paket","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"TgdM52WGT6"}],"key":"bLQ5X8AJAU"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"terra, yang merupakan penerus dari paket raster dengan kinerja lebih baik. Proses yang dicakup meliputi:\nMembaca Data: Memuat data DEM dalam format raster (.tif) menggunakan fungsi rast().\nMengkalkulasi kemiringan lereng (slope) dan arah lereng (aspect) dari data DEM menggunakan fungsi terrain().\nMembuat Hillshade: Menghasilkan visualisasi efek bayangan (hillshade) untuk memberikan kesan 3D pada topografi dengan fungsi shade().\nVisualisasi: Menampilkan tiga peta (Slope, Topografi, dan Hillshade) secara berdampingan dalam satu layout untuk memudahkan interpretasi.\nProyek ini bertujuan untuk menyediakan contoh praktis bagi pengguna yang tertarik pada analisis data spasial di bidang kehutanan, konservasi, tata guna lahan, dan mitigasi bencana menggunakan R.","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"FDXHYjTokm"}],"key":"kI1b8ycYWu"}],"key":"YCgZoTBfRw"}],"key":"gFP5IZrcyd"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"f